cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this report or its data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "The Penniless Agent: can an AI with a $20 plan make money for an ordinary person?"
abstract: >-
  A running field report on whether an AI assistant with a consumer plan, no money and no
  accounts can earn money for an ordinary person. Includes a seven-day field study (July 2026),
  a quarterly update, the blockers in the way, and a daily market series on how much small
  sellers earn from AI agents over x402.
